 the path given as destination parameter, in case it is set. Usually the destination parameter is set by appending it to the URL, e.g. http://example.com/user/login?destination=node/2";s:8:"optional";b:1;s:13:"default value";b:1;}s:11:"destination";a:6:{s:4:"type";s:7:"boolean";s:5:"label";s:28:"Append destination parameter";s:11:"restriction";s:5:"input";s:11:"description";s:125:"Whether to append a destination parameter to the URL, so another redirect issued later on would lead back to the origin page.";s:8:"optional";b:1;s:13:"default value";b:0;}}s:15:"access callback";s:31:"rules_system_integration_access";s:6:"module";s:5:"rules";s:8:"provides";a:0:{}s:11:"faces_cache";a:1:{s:24:"RulesPluginImplInterface";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:"execute";a:1:{i:0;s:24:"rules_action_drupal_goto";}}i:1;a:1:{s:7:"execute";s:19:"modules/system.eval";}}}}s:14:"breadcrumb_set";a:7:{s:5:"label";s:44:"Establecer enlaces de ayuda a la navegación";s:5:"group";s:7:"Sistema";s:9:"parameter";a:2:{s:6:"titles";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:10:"list<text>";s:5:"label";s:8:"Títulos";s:11:"description";s:42:"A list of titles for the breadcrumb links.";}s:5:"paths";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:10:"list<text>";s:5:"label";s:5:"Rutas";s:11:"description";s:82:"A list of Drupal paths for the breadcrumb links, matching the order of the titles.";}}s:15:"access callback";s:31:"rules_system_integration_access";s:6:"module";s:5:"rules";s:8:"provides";a:0:{}s:11:"faces_cache";a:1:{s:24:"RulesPluginImplInterface";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:"execute";a:1:{i:0;s:27:"rules_action_breadcrumb_set";}}i:1;a:1:{s:7:"execute";s:19:"modules/system.eval";}}}}s:4:"mail";a:7:{s:5:"label";s:13:"Enviar correo";s:5:"group";s:7:"Sistema";s:9:"parameter";a:4:{s:2:"to";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:4:"text";s:5:"label";s:4:"Para";s:11:"description";s:123:"The e-mail address or addresses where the message will be sent to. The formatting of this string must comply with RFC 2822.";}s:7:"subject";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:4:"text";s:5:"label";s:6:"Asunto";s:11:"description";s:21:"El asunto del correo.";}s:7:"message";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:4:"text";s:5:"label";s:7:"Mensaje";s:11:"description";s:21:"El cuerpo del correo.";}s:4:"from";a:4:{s:4:"type";s:4:"text";s:5:"label";s:2:"De";s:11:"description";s:119:"El correo electrónico desde el cual se envia el correo. Dejar vacio para usar el correo electrónico global del sitio.";s:8:"optional";b:1;}}s:15:"access callback";s:31:"rules_system_integration_access";s:6:"module";s:5:"rules";s:8:"provides";a:0:{}s:11:"faces_cache";a:1:{s:24:"RulesPluginImplInterface";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:"execute";a:1:{i:0;s:17:"rules_action_mail";}}i:1;a:1:{s:7:"execute";s:19:"modules/system.eval";}}}}s:21:"mail_to_users_of_role";a:7:{s:5:"label";s:38:"Enviar correo a los usuarios de un rol";s:5:"group";s:7:"Sistema";s:9:"parameter";a:4:{s:5:"roles";a:4:{s:4:"type";s:13:"list<integer>";s:5:"label";s:5:"Roles";s:12:"options list";s:26:"entity_metadata_user_roles";s:11:"description";s:53:"Select the roles whose users should receive the mail.";}s:7:"subject";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:4:"text";s:5:"label";s:6:"Asunto";s:11:"description";s:21:"El asunto del correo.";}s:7:"message";a:3:{s:4:"type";s:4:"text";s:5:"label";s:7:"Mensaje";s:11:"description";s:21:"El cuerpo del correo.";}s:4:"from";a:4:{s:4:"type";s:4:"text";s:5:"label";s:2:"De";s:11:"description";s:119:"El correo electrónico desde el cual se envia el correo. Dejar vacio para usar el correo electrónico global del sitio.";s:8:"optional";b:1;}}s:15:"access callback";s:31:"rules_system_integration_access";s:6:"module";s:5:"rules";s:8:"provides";a:0:{}s:11:"faces_cache";a:2:{s:24:"RulesPluginImplInterface";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:7:"execute";a:1:{i:0;s:34:"rules_action_mail_to_users_of_role";}}i:1;a:1:{s:7:"execute";s:19:"modules/system.eval";}}s:22:"RulesPluginUIInterface";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:4:"help";a:1:{i:0;s:39:"rules_action_mail_to_users_of_role_help";}}i:1;a:1:{s:4:"help";s:20:"modules/system.rules";}}}}s:13:"user_add_role";a:7:{s:9:"parameter";a:2:{s:7:"account";a:4:{s:4:"type";s:4:"user";s:5